# Connector: Puesto que
<!-- id: c1_connector_puesto_que | level: C1 | topic: connectors | type: cloze -->

> **Grammar Rule**: 'Puesto que' (since) is a causal connector that always takes the indicative.

### Context
English: "Since you are here, help me."

### Exercise
Puesto que tú (estar) ___ aquí, ayúdame.

<!-- SOLUTION
estás
-->

